    "explanation": "Both parties: this dispute is decided on the driver's own GPS trace. The driver tapped 'I'm Here' at 12:30:36 and the platform's wait timer ran, but under POL-NS-02 the driver is deemed to have arrived only if the trace shows at least 3 consecutive fixes inside the arrival radius for the zone class. Tampines Mall is a LARGE_VENUE, so that radius is 120 m (fee_schedule.arrival_radius_m). The driver's trace (91 fixes, 10-second cadence, 100% coverage, no gaps) never places him closer than 258.2 m to the pickup pin and records zero qualifying in-geofence fixes. POL-NS-01 limb (b) therefore fails, and with limb (c) unserved (0 seconds of in-geofence dwell against the 180-second free waiting period in trip_record.platform_policy.free_wait_sec) the SGD 4.50 cancellation fee is not chargeable. The driver's closest position, 258.2 m, lies outside the arrival radius but within the 400 m ceiling of POL-NS-03, so fault is allocated from the chat log. At 12:30:56 the rider sent 'im at the main entrance next to the taxi stand, block A' — her own position — and the driver replied only 'ok' at 12:31:26 and did not move to that entrance before cancelling at 12:34:59. Under POL-NS-03(i) the driver bears the loss and receives no compensation. The rider is refunded the full SGD 4.50 (fare ledger cancellation_fee = SGD 4.50, total_charged = SGD 4.50, payment_status CHARGED, refund_issued_sgd = 0.00). Driver's counsel: the trace is complete (accepted); the 'arrived' event exists (accepted, but limb (a) alone does not carry POL-NS-01); the rider was within 12.95–19.90 m of the pin (accepted); compensation computes to SGD 3.60 under POL-NS-07 (rejected — POL-NS-07 pays only where POL-NS-01 is satisfied in full, and it is not); the anti-farming check does not trip (no_show_terminations_30d = 1 against completed_trips_30d = 92, rate 0.011, both under the POL-NS-07 thresholds), which is accepted but moot because no compensation is due at all. Rider's counsel: POL-NS-04 is